# 📂 MCP Project Catalog

A detailed look at the Model Context Protocol (MCP) servers in the sandraschi fleet.
Every server features a vibrant webapp sidecar for human control and real-time telemetry.

---

## 🧱 Maker Pipeline — CAD → Simulation → Viz → Export

The newest and most ambitious layer. Creative input, parametric CAD, CFD simulation,
game engine visualization, and export to XR, web, and desktop — all connected via MCP bridges.

| [![Godot](assets/card_godot.svg)](https://github.com/sandraschi/godot-mcp#readme) | [![FreeCAD](assets/card_freecad.svg)](https://github.com/sandraschi/freecad-mcp#readme) |
| :--- | :--- |
| **[godot-mcp](https://github.com/sandraschi/godot-mcp)** | **[freecad-mcp](https://github.com/sandraschi/freecad-mcp)** |
| Godot 4 engine control via MCP. STL import, CFD velocity fields, GPU particles, PBR materials, HTML5 export. The fleet's visualization endpoint. | Parametric CAD via MCP. STEP/BIM/IFC for architecture and mechanical engineering. |

| [![QCAD](assets/card_qcad.svg)](https://github.com/sandraschi/qcad-mcp#readme) | [![Blender](assets/card_blender.svg)](https://github.com/sandraschi/blender-mcp#readme) |
| :--- | :--- |
| **[qcad-mcp](https://github.com/sandraschi/qcad-mcp)** | **[blender-mcp](https://github.com/sandraschi/blender-mcp)** |
| 2D/3D drafting via MCP. DXF/STL export. Depot management and file watchers. | Automated 3D mesh and scene generation via Blender Python API. |

| [![GIMP](assets/card_gimp.svg)](https://github.com/sandraschi/gimp-mcp#readme) | [![WorldLabs](assets/card_worldlabs.svg)](https://github.com/sandraschi/worldlabs-mcp#readme) |
| :--- | :--- |
| **[gimp-mcp](https://github.com/sandraschi/gimp-mcp)** | **[worldlabs-mcp](https://github.com/sandraschi/worldlabs-mcp)** |
| Automated image processing and texture pipeline for asset creation. | AI-driven world and terrain generation. Landscape design for virtual environments. |

| [![Inkscape](assets/card_inkscape.svg)](https://github.com/sandraschi/inkscape-mcp#readme) | [![DaVinci](assets/card_davinci.svg)](https://github.com/sandraschi/davinci-resolve-mcp#readme) |
| :--- | :--- |
| **[inkscape-mcp](https://github.com/sandraschi/inkscape-mcp)** | **[davinci-resolve-mcp](https://github.com/sandraschi/davinci-resolve-mcp)** |
| Vector graphics and SVG illustration automation substrate. | Automated post-production and color grading pipeline. |

